hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"281","(48) Witr ka bab: Ibn al-Muqri aur Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do rak'at hai, pas jab tum subah ka khauf karo to ek rak'at ke saath witr parh lo. Mahmud ne izafa kiya: Jo guzar chuki usay tumhare liye taaq bana degi."
"282","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ya'fur se, Muslim ibn Subayh se, Masruq se, Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne raat ke har hisse me witr parha, pas Aap ka witr sehri tak khatam hota tha."
"283","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, A'mash se, Abu Sufyan se, Jabir ibn Abdullah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se jo dare ke wo raat ke aakhir me bedar na hoga to wo awwal hisse me witr parh kar so jaye, aur tum me se jo ummeed rakhe ke wo raat ke aakhir me bedar hoga to wo aakhir me witr parhe, kyunke aakhri raat ki namaz hazir ki jati hai, pas wahi afzal hai."
